It is afternoon.
I sit in front of the computer at the office.
I write the software code.
I test the code.
The time goes quickly.
Now it is evening.
I save the files on the computer.
I finish my work.
I place the computer in the bag.
I stand up.
I look at Rohan.
"Rohan, I am going home now," I say.
Rohan smiles.
"Goodbye, Maya."
"See you tomorrow," he says.
I look at the other colleagues.
I wave my hand.
"Good evening, everyone," I say.
I take the bag.
I go outside the office building.
